            <title>[IGNITE-17863] ThreadNameValidationTest fails if run alone (or first in suite)</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-17863</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This seems to happen because code that configures Log4j logging system triggers creation of a thread factory after the test saves the count of created thread factories, so the test thinks that there is some production code doing so, even though it&apos;s an artifact of our test code.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
